<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Mashar</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #F0F2F5; color: #1A1A2E; padding: 40px 16px; }
        .email-wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid #E1E5ED; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; }
        .top-accent { height: 5px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #F5A623 0%, #F7B733 100%); border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0; }
        .email-header { background-color: #1A237E; padding: 32px 40px 28px; text-align: center; }
        .logo-container { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 18px; }
        .logo-image { max-height: 60px; max-width: 200px; width: auto; }
        .brand-logo { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F5A623; margin-top: 8px; }
        .header-title { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .header-subtitle { font-size: 14px; color: #B0B8E8; }
        .email-body { background-color: #FFFFFF; padding: 40px 40px 36px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 16px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .greeting strong { color: #1A237E; font-weight: 600; }
        .body-text { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #555; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .cta-wrap { text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 28px; }
        .cta-btn { display: inline-block; background-color: #1A237E; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; padding: 15px 40px; border-radius: 50px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
        .contact-info { padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #EAECF5; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #666; }
        .signature { padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #EAECF5; margin-top: 24px; }
        .sig-warm { font-size: 14px; color: #888; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .sig-name { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1A237E; }
        .sig-role { font-size: 12px; color: #AAA; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 3px; }
        .email-footer { background-color: #1A237E; border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px; padding: 24px 40px; text-align: center; }
        .footer-note { font-size: 11px; color: #B0B8E8; line-height: 1.7; }
        .footer-note a { color: #F5A623; text-decoration: none; }
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .email-header, .email-body { padding: 28px 24px; }
            .header-title { font-size: 20px; }
            .email-footer { padding: 20px 24px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="email-wrapper">
    <div class="top-accent"></div>
    <div class="email-header">
        <% if (logoUrl) { %>
            <div class="logo-container">
                <img class="logo-image" src="<%= logoUrl %>" alt="Mashar" />
            </div>
        <% } %>
        <div class="brand-logo">Mashar · Leadership Community</div>
        <h1 class="header-title">Welcome to Mashar</h1>
        <p class="header-subtitle">Where Leadership Grows with Purpose, Clarity and Impact</p>
    </div>
    <div class="email-body">
        <p class="greeting">Hi <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
        <p class="body-text">
            Thank you for joining the Mashar leadership community. We're reimagining leadership for a world that's changing fast and we're excited to have you with us.
        </p>
        <p class="body-text">
            As promised, your <strong>Future Ready Leadership Toolkit</strong> is ready to download. Inside, you'll find practical frameworks and insights designed to help you lead with clarity, confidence, and impact.
        </p>
        
        <div class="cta-wrap">
            <a href="<%= downloadLink %>" class="cta-btn" style="color: #FFFFFF;">Download the Leadership Toolkit</a>
        </div>
        
        <p class="body-text">
            If you have any questions or would like to discuss an idea or reflect on a challenge, you're welcome to reach out.
        </p>
        
        <div class="contact-info">
            <p>You can connect with <strong>Raja'a Allaho</strong>, our Lead Coach, at <a href="mailto:raja@mashar.org" style="color: #1A237E; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">raja@mashar.org</a> or with <strong>Elise Karaa</strong>, Head of Experience &amp; Partnerships, at <a href="mailto:elise@mashar.org" style="color: #1A237E; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">elise@mashar.org</a>.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="signature">
            <p class="sig-warm">Warm regards,</p>
            <div class="sig-name">Mashar Coaching &amp; Training Academy</div>
            <div class="sig-role">Lead with purpose. Be Future Ready.</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="email-footer">
        <p class="footer-note">
            Kuwait | GCC · <a href="mailto:info@mashar.org">info@mashar.org</a> · Tel: +965 222 811 97 · WhatsApp: +1 (613) 261-3210 (Elise)<br>
            © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Mashar. All rights reserved.<br>
            <a href="https://mashar.org/">mashar.org</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
